Shadcn Theme for Odoo 18
A modern, sleek theme inspired by shadcn/ui design system.

This theme is built for Odoo 18 and provides a clean, professional appearance
with smooth animations and excellent user experience.

The theme is inspired by shadcn/ui (https://ui.shadcn.com/) design principles
but is an independent implementation for Odoo.
